  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OECD Korea Policy Centre&apos;s Outreach Programme on Taxation, Competition, Public Governance, Social and Health Policies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(1) Training and Knowledge Sharing on international tax policies, such as tax treaties and transfer pricing, BEPS project for tax officials and experts in developing countries
(2) Training on OECD&apos;s advanced competition policies and best practices for officials of competition authorities and judges  in the Asia-Pacific region
(3) Asian Public Governance Forums and Capacity Building Programs on open and digital government for government officials in developing nations of the Asia Pacific region
(4) Disseminating advanced policy systems to government officials and experts of health, social and pensions sectors in developing nations and hosting seminars for experts</narrative>
  </description>
